          "summary": "1,129 sections. The mode tab strip is not authored as a strip: ShowModeTabs (NewBattleFieldQueue.decompiled.lua:4374-4451) hides every tab, then shows only the battlefield ids bound to the entry point and pins them at SetRelX(18 + i*100). InitWndBattleField (lua:4713-4744) drops modes whose IsActivityOn is false, which is why the live queue window shows 五人模式/单人模式/寻宝模式/自定义模式 (乱武模式 676 is off). Visibility follows the engine's LockShowAndHide flag (KGUI decoder clears the visible flag of locked sections; the window script is the only thing that shows them), so locked state widgets stay hidden and the script-shown ones (tabs, activity badges) are listed. The 五人模式 tab handler also sets Text_SkillTitle to STR_DESERTSTORM_TITLE (lua:4477-4488) and Text_TIP_DSTime to the schedule (lua:4350-4372). The reference screenshot state (proof/minimap/screenshots/Screenshot-given-1.png) additionally pins the 赛季 tab badges (Image_AnniversaryIcon1/2/3 at frame 23 of PartnerTeam.UITex, UpdateAnniversaryTabIcon lua:6506-6553; the INI default frame 21 is 周年), the player sample values (个人评分 1873, 飞沙令 10000/10000 via inventory `texts`), and the window's own string table string_ArenaCorpsPanel.txt, whose committed UTF-8 copy in Data/text resolves the labels the generic string.txt lacks.",
